<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In Efficient Training-Free Online Routing for High-Volume Multi-LLM Serving" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Extended Related Work</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
</nav>
